,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-11-24T20:47:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T23:39:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.5.stable.fedora.876b29033\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.5.1.stable.official\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.5.1.stable.steam\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (nvidia; 580.105.08) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8700 CPU @ 3.20GHz (12 threads) - 31.18 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAdding a Color to a Color, even when the latter is pure black (i.e Color(0,0,0)), causes circles drawn using that Color to only show the difference of their colours while overlapping while 2D HDR is enabled:\n\n<img width=\"92\" height=\"66\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82edf32c-1f35-43a1-8b2d-005127644865\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEnable HDR 2D and attach this script to a Node2D:\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\tvar colour: Color = Color(\"green\") + Color(0, 0, 0)\n\tdraw_circle(Vector2(100, 100), 20, colour, true, -1.0, false)\n\tdraw_circle(Vector2(120, 100), 20, colour, true, -1.0, false)\n```\nRemoving `+ Color(0, 0, 0)` should make the issue disappear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[circle_overlap.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23731826/circle_overlap.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}